<td id="S4.T2.fig2.1.1.8.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">   MNLI <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib44" title="" class="ltx_ref">Williams et al., 2018</a>)</cite></td>
