<td id="S4.T2.fig2.1.1.9.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">   <math id="S4.T2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\delta" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>δ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\delta</annotation></semantics></math>-NLI <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib36" title="" class="ltx_ref">Rudinger et al., 2020</a>)</cite></td>
