<td id="S4.T2.fig2.1.1.9.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">✓</td></tr>
<tr id="S4.T2.fig2.1.1.10" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S4.T2.fig2.1.1.10.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">   <math id="S4.T2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\delta" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>δ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\delta</annotation></semantics></math>-CAUSAL <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib8" title="" class="ltx_ref">Cui et al., 2024</a>)</cite></td>
